#: src/diagnostics.md:3
msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "診斷"

#: src/diagnostics.md:5
msgid ""
"Zed gets its diagnostics from the language servers and supports both push "
"and pull variants of the LSP which makes it compatible with all existing "
"language servers."
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:7
msgid "Regular diagnostics"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:9
msgid ""
"By default, Zed displays all diagnostics as underlined text in the editor "
"and the scrollbar."
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:11
msgid "Editor diagnostics could be filtered with the"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:14
msgid "\"diagnostics_max_severity\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:17
msgid ""
"editor setting (possible values: `\"off\"`, `\"error\"`, `\"warning\"`, "
"`\"info\"`, `\"hint\"`, `null` (default, all diagnostics))."
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:19
msgid "The scrollbar ones are configured with the"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:22
msgid "\"scrollbar\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:23 src/diagnostics.md:38
msgid "\"diagnostics\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:23 src/diagnostics.md:56
msgid "\"all\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:27
msgid ""
"configuration (possible values: `\"none\"`, `\"error\"`, `\"warning\"`, "
"`\"information\"`, `\"all\"` (default))"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:29
msgid ""
"The diagnostics could be hovered to display a tooltip with full, rendered "
"diagnostic message. Or, `editor::GoToDiagnostic` and `editor::"
"GoToPreviousDiagnostic` could be used to navigate between diagnostics in the "
"editor, showing a popover for the currently active diagnostic."
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:32
msgid "Inline diagnostics (Error lens)"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:34
msgid ""
"Zed supports showing diagnostic as lens to the right of the code. This is "
"disabled by default, but can either be temporarily turned on (or off) using "
"the editor menu, or permanently, using the"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:39
msgid "\"inline\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:40
msgid "\"enabled\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:41
msgid "\"max_severity\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:41
msgid ""
"// same values as the `diagnostics_max_severity` from the editor settings\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:46
msgid "Other UI places"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:48
msgid "Project Panel"
msgstr "專案面板"

#: src/diagnostics.md:50
msgid ""
"Project panel can have its entries coloured based on the severity of the "
"diagnostics in the file."
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:52
msgid "To configure, use"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:55
msgid "\"project_panel\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:56 src/diagnostics.md:68
msgid "\"show_diagnostics\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:60
msgid ""
"configuration (possible values: `\"off\"`, `\"errors\"`, `\"all\"` (default))"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:62
msgid "Editor tabs"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:64
msgid "Similar to the project panel, editor tabs can be colorized with the"
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:67
msgid "\"tabs\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:68
msgid "\"off\""
msgstr ""

#: src/diagnostics.md:72
msgid ""
"configuration (possible values: `\"off\"` (default), `\"errors\"`, `\"all\"`)"
msgstr ""
